---
const rows = [
  [
    'LOCAL',
    'c-green',
    'Parakeet v3 transcription, Pocket TTS and Supertonic-3 voices, Fix words, the HUD. Downloaded once, then run offline.',
  ],
  [
    'KEYS',
    'c-cyan',
    'OpenRouter and Jev keys live in your login Keychain, under your Developer ID-signed app. Nothing to sign up for here.',
  ],
  [
    'DATA',
    'c-purple',
    'Tracks and vocabulary are commented TOML in ~/.config/voice-pipes; history is JSON in Application Support. Edit them, back them up, clear them.',
  ],
  [
    'CLOUD',
    'c-yellow',
    "Only the blocks you choose: an OpenRouter model, a Jev route or branch, an HTTP request you wrote. Read aloud's branch asks Jev only once you've added a Jev key.",
  ],
];
---

<section id="local" class="sec">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="stack">
      <span class="eyebrow">On your Mac</span>
      <h2 class="display h2">home on the range</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        The fast path never leaves your machine. Cloud models are there when you pick them, with your own keys.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card list list--rows">
      {
        rows.map(([label, color, text]) => (
          <div>
            <span class={`row-label ${color}`}>{label}</span>
            <span class="row-text">
              {text}
              {label === 'KEYS' && ' '}
              {label === 'KEYS' && <a href="/setup">Where to get each key →</a>}
            </span>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
